press LT once charged to flash with a controller. Updated the on-screen control hints to match. Fixed repeated sprint inputs allowing continued dashing at near-empty stamina. Fixed the protagonist turning sideways before the fade to black after checkou","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-18T12:04:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010494573","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:16:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3991760-1843481262691692","game_id":"steam-3991760","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo V0.65: Jumpscare and Control Improvements","summary":"The Night Portable demo has been updated to V0.65. This update focuses on jumpscare presentation, controls, and gameplay fixes. Jumpscare presentation Adjusted lighting, facial expressions and movement, camera motion, sound effects, and screen effects. Updated how held items are shown during jumpscares so the handheld console and work tools no longer obscure the face. Control improvements Added an option to swap the left and right mouse buttons. Control icons and instructions change to match the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-10T09:58:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262691692","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:16:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3991760-1843481262688676","game_id":"steam-3991760","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo V0.642: Retry Screen Bug Fix","summary":"The Night Portable demo has been updated to V0.642. Fixed an issue where cracks remained on the handheld screen after retrying. Thank you for reporting this issue.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-09T10:53:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262688676","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:16:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3991760-1842846814455621","game_id":"steam-3991760","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo V0.64: Make more time for handheld games during your shift","summary":"The Night Portable demo has been updated to V0.64. Based on gameplay videos and player feedback, this update brings changes to the handheld games, the tutorial, and UI readability. The main idea is simple: play a little, get back to work, then pick up where you left off. These changes are designed to make earning items more manageable while you keep up with your duties and watch your surroundings. Main changes Pause and resume your handheld games During your shift, all three handheld games now r","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-08T13:17:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814455621","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:16:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3991760-1842846814452411","game_id":"steam-3991760","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo V0.633: Fixed controller scrolling in PC emails","summary":"Fixed an issue that prevented scrolling through email messages on the PC screen with a controller. With an email open, move the right stick up or down, or use the D-pad, to scroll through the message.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-07T07:48:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814452411","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:16:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3991760-1842846814451911","game_id":"steam-3991760","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo V0.632: Enemy firing adjustments in the space shooter","summary":"The Night Portable demo has been updated to V0.632. This update adjusts enemy fire in the space shooter on the Kizupota, preventing enemies from aiming backward at your ship after passing it. Space shooter adjustments Regular enemies and mid-bosses now aim only within a 140-degree forward arc (70 degrees to either side). They will not aim at your ship when it is behind them. Fixed an issue that gave regular enemies different firing-angle limits on the left and right. Adjusted the mid-boss's two-","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-07T00:47:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814451911","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:16:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3991760-1842846814450149","game_id":"steam-3991760","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo V0.631: Mild Mode Balance and Interaction Improvements","summary":"The Night Portable demo has been updated from V0.63 to V0.631. This update adjusts Mild mode and improves interactions, on-screen guidance, and sound effects. Mild Mode Adjustments Increased Flash uses from 3 to 6. Two battery icons in the upper-left corner now show your remaining charges. Using a Battery item fully restores all 6 Flash charges. Added one extra chance to survive contact with ■■■. The first contact no longer cracks the Kizupota screen; the usual damage stages begin with the secon","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-06T03:53:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814450149","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:16:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3991760-1842212951309615","game_id":"steam-3991760","kind":"announcement","title":"Night Portable Demo | Video & Streaming Guidelines","summary":"Thank you for your interest in Night Portable! Here are our video and streaming guidelines for the Steam demo, scheduled for release on September 5, 2026. You are welcome to show the entire demo. There are no restricted scenes or sections. First-time reactions, thorough playthroughs, and everything in between are welcome. We hope you and your viewers enjoy your night shift! What you can share Once the demo is publicly available, you may record, upload, and stream it from beginning to end. Let's ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-31T09:09:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951309615","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:16:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3991760-1840944183779481","game_id":"steam-3991760","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Playtest Now Open — Demo Launches Sep 5 at Around 6:20 PM JST","summary":"Thank you for supporting Night Portable. Steam Playtest Now Open The Steam Playtest for the Windows version currently in development is now accepting players. We would especially appreciate feedback on how clearly the game communicates what to do next, controls and UI usability, difficulty, horror presentation, and any bugs or progress-blocking issues you encounter. Playtest Period From the publication of this announcement until around 6:20 PM JST on Saturday, September 5, 2026 The Playtest is s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-14T12:22:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183779481","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:16:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3991760-1840310314340826","game_id":"steam-3991760","kind":"announcement","title":"Preparing a Public Playtest for Night Portable","summary":"Thank you for supporting Night Portable.I am currently preparing a public playtest of the Windows version currently in development.For this test, I hope to receive feedback from players experiencing the game for the first time, particularly regarding:• How clearly the game communicates what to do next• Controls, menus, and overall usability• Difficulty and pacing• Horror presentation and story engagement• Progress-blocking issues, visual problems, audio problems, and other bugsPlease note that t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-06T04:32:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314340826","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:16:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3991760-1839041357027256","game_id":"steam-3991760","kind":"announcement","title":"From Complete Beginner to Showcasing “Night Portable” at Events","summary":"Hello, I’m Kabocha Misoshiru from Pumpkin Miso Studio. I work an office job in Sapporo, Hokkaido, and spend my evenings and days off developing Night Portable, a horror game made with Unity 6, mostly on my own. When I first started making games, I had never used Unity, C#, or Blender. At the end of 2024, I installed Unity and began teaching myself through courses, videos, and documentation. After learning the basics by creating small projects, I started developing Night Portable around mid-Febru","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-23T16:44:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357027256","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:16:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3991760":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:21:52Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:21:52Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3991760":"2026-10-26T11:21:52Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3991760":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10